{
    "title": "Robbery Bob - King of Sneak",
    "description": "Introducing the legendary thief\u2026\r\n\r\nPlay as Bob in this game, the sneaky burglar with a good heart. Unfortunately for Bob, however, he's going to be forced into a few final jobs before he's allowed out of the criminal life.\r\n\r\nRobbery Bob is a fun and humor packed adventure stealth game that will get you into luxurious villas and past puzzles filled with guards, dogs and other enemies to come out with your pockets full of loot! And it's Free to Play game!\r\n\r\n<h1><b> FEATURES </b></h1>\r\nThese are just some of the things that make Robbery Bob such a fun stealth puzzle game to play:\r\n\r\n<b>\u2022 SUPER SNEAKY </b>\r\nSneak past security guards, residents and sleeping dogs as you rob the loot in each stage. Use your ninja and also puzzle solving skills to hide in some tight squeezes and avoid getting detected as a thief.\r\n\r\n<b>\u2022 EXPLORE DIFFERENT MAPS </b>\r\nYour sticky-fingered missions involving stealth and puzzles will take you through a local neighbourhood, Downtown, and even through some secret labs. Can you get a perfect on every one? Can Rob the legendary thief  rob every item in the level?\r\n\r\n<b>\u2022 PLAY FOR THE LOOT</b>\r\nBob is going to have to steal and rob everything from secret documents, to old pairs of clothes, to those always hard-to-find TV remotes! \r\n\r\n<b>\u2022 CRIME IS A FUNNY OLD GAME </b>\r\nGet engrossed in the comical funny storyline featuring hilarious animations, a fun script, rewarding puzzles and a genuinely twisting narrative and a lot of robbing!\r\n\r\nDownload and play for free! Don't forget to be stealthy!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Introducing the legendary thief\u2026<br><br>Play as Bob in this game, the sneaky burglar with a good heart. Unfortunately for Bob, however, he&#39;s going to be forced into a few final jobs before he&#39;s allowed out of the criminal life.<br><br>Robbery Bob is a fun and humor packed adventure stealth game that will get you into luxurious villas and past puzzles filled with guards, dogs and other enemies to come out with your pockets full of loot! And it&#39;s Free to Play game!<br><br><h1><b> FEATURES </b></h1><br>These are just some of the things that make Robbery Bob such a fun stealth puzzle game to play:<br><br><b>\u2022 SUPER SNEAKY </b><br>Sneak past security guards, residents and sleeping dogs as you rob the loot in each stage. Use your ninja and also puzzle solving skills to hide in some tight squeezes and avoid getting detected as a thief.<br><br><b>\u2022 EXPLORE DIFFERENT MAPS </b><br>Your sticky-fingered missions involving stealth and puzzles will take you through a local neighbourhood, Downtown, and even through some secret labs. Can you get a perfect on every one? Can Rob the legendary thief  rob every item in the level?<br><br><b>\u2022 PLAY FOR THE LOOT</b><br>Bob is going to have to steal and rob everything from secret documents, to old pairs of clothes, to those always hard-to-find TV remotes! <br><br><b>\u2022 CRIME IS A FUNNY OLD GAME </b><br>Get engrossed in the comical funny storyline featuring hilarious animations, a fun script, rewarding puzzles and a genuinely twisting narrative and a lot of robbing!<br><br>Download and play for free! Don&#39;t forget to be stealthy!",
